function valueLabel(f,v){if(f==='status'&&v==='已删除')return '已作废';if(f==='funds'&&v&&typeof v==='object')return [v.direction,A.methods().find(x=>x.id===v.methodId)?.name,A.accounts().find(x=>x.id===v.accountId)?.name,'¥'+K.money(v.amountCents)].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');if(f==='returnLines'&&Array.isArray(v))return v.map(l=>l.productId+' '+l.color+' '+l.size+' '+l.quantity+l.unit+' ¥'+K.money(l.priceCents)).join('；')||'无';return f==='warehouseId'?wh(v):f==='customerId'?customer(v):f==='salespersonId'?staff(v):['priceCents','adjustmentCents'].includes(f)&&v!==''?K.money(v):typeof v==='boolean'?v?'是':'否':v===''?'—':v}
function diffHTML(a,d){return K.changes(a,d).map(x=>`<li>${h(x.label||'单据')} · ${labels[x.field]||h(x.field)}：${h(valueLabel(x.field,x.before))} → ${h(valueLabel(x.field,x.after))}</li>`).join('')}
function reasonModal(kind){const old=S.docs.find(x=>x.id===U.doc.id);modal(kind==='void'?'整单误录作废':'确认更正',`<p class="sale-impact">${kind==='void'?h('作废单号 '+old.id+'；原单内容和金额保留；库存及有效收退款记录不变'):impactSummary(old,U.doc)}</p><p>${kind==='void'?'作废未审核单据，不影响库存或收退款，保留操作记录。':'保存修改后仍待审核，库存及收退款将在审核后生效。'}</p><p>此操作用于录单纠错；顾客实际退货请新增退货销货单，不用纠错代替。</p>${kind==='save'?`<div class="sale-diff"><ul>${diffHTML(old,U.doc)}</ul><p>成交金额 ${K.money(K.totals(old).total)} → ${K.money(K.totals(U.doc).total)}</p><p>${h(wh(old.warehouseId))} 原出库 ${h(K.unitText(K.totals(old).units))} → ${h(wh(U.doc.warehouseId))} 新出库 ${h(K.unitText(K.totals(U.doc).units))}</p></div>`:''}<label>原因<select id="sale-reason">${['数量录错','规格录错','价格录错','仓库选错','整单误录','其他'].map(x=>`<option${kind==='void'&&x==='整单误录'?' selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>说明（选择其他时必填）<input id="sale-reason-note" maxlength="200"></label><p id="sale-modal-error" role="alert"></p>`,b('取消','close')+b(kind==='void'?'确认作废':'确认更正','reason-confirm',`data-kind="${kind}"`,'primary'),null,'sale-reason-dialog')}

async function commit(kind,reason=''){
 if(kind==='delete'&&(!U.doc?.revision||U.doc.status!=='未审核'))return toast('只有已保存的未审核单据可以作废');
 if(U.busy)return;if(['save','audit'].includes(kind)&&validateAdjustment()){validationError(U.adjustmentError);document.querySelector('[data-document-adjustment]')?.focus();return}if(kind==='audit'&&U.editing&&dirty()){if(!flushInline())return;await workTail;const err=Object.keys(U.priceErrors).length?'成交单价需为有效金额，最多两位小数':K.validation(U.doc,S.catalog,D.warehouses.filter(w=>w.enabled!==false).map(w=>w.id),D.warehouses)||SALES_FUNDS_UI.validate?.(U.doc,{audit:true});if(err){validationError(err);return}await commit('save');if(U.error||U.busy)return;return commit('audit')}if(['save','audit'].includes(kind)&&!flushInline())return;await workTail;if(['save','audit'].includes(kind)){const err=Object.keys(U.priceErrors).length?'成交单价需为有效金额，最多两位小数':K.validation(U.doc,S.catalog,D.warehouses.filter(w=>w.enabled!==false).map(w=>w.id),D.warehouses)||SALES_FUNDS_UI.validate?.(U.doc,{audit:kind==='audit'});if(err){validationError(err);return}if(kind==='save'&&U.doc.revision&&!dirty())return toast('内容没有变化');}
 if(kind==='delete')U.pendingRequest=null;
 const command=U.pendingRequest||{type:'write',kind,docId:U.doc.id,baseRevision:U.doc.revision,requestId:crypto.randomUUID(),draft:copy(U.doc),reason};U.pendingRequest=command;U.busy=true;U.error='';stash();refresh();const r=await S.call(command);
 if(!r.ok){U.busy=false;const business=['VALIDATION','FUNDS','MINIMUM_PRICE','SPEC','SCOPE'].includes(r.code);if(kind==='audit'&&business){U.editing=true;U.pendingRequest=null;}U.error=r.error;U.conflict=['REVISION','RECOVERED'].includes(r.code);U.latest=r.latest;stash();refresh();if(business)validationError(r.error);return}const synced=await S.sync();const saved=window.REAL_DATA_MODE?r.doc:synced.ok?(S.docs.find(d=>d.id===r.doc.id)||r.doc):r.doc;setDoc(saved,saved.status==='未审核'&&!!S.session?.permissions.includes('save'));U.busy=false;if(!synced.ok)U.message='操作已保存；列表刷新失败，可稍后重新查询';else U.message=({save:'已保存，尚未审核，不影响库存',audit:A.payment(U.doc).direction==='无'?'已审核，库存已更新':A.type(U.doc)==='销售'?'已审核，库存已更新，结算明细已保存':A.type(U.doc)==='退货'?'已审核，库存已更新，结算明细已保存':'已审核，库存已更新，结算明细已保存',unaudit:'已退回未审核，库存影响已撤销，结算明细保留，可修改后重新审核',void:'已作废',delete:'单据已作废，操作历史已保留'})[kind];if(kind==='save'||kind==='audit')SALES_FUNDS_UI.remember(U.doc);if(!['void','delete'].includes(kind)&&entryDoc().lines.some(l=>{const product=p(l.productId);return product?.stock[U.doc.warehouseId]?.[product.colorIds.indexOf(l.colorId)]?.[product.sizeIds.indexOf(l.sizeId)]<0}))U.message+='；部分规格现存为负，可继续录单';U.route='sales/doc/'+encodeURIComponent(r.doc.id);history.replaceState(null,'','#'+U.route);refresh();
}
function showHistory(){modal('操作历史',U.doc.history.slice().reverse().map(r=>`<article class="tc-history"><strong>${h(r.action==='删除'?'作废':r.action)} · v${r.revisionBefore} → v${r.revisionAfter}</strong><small>${h(r.actor.name)} · ${stamp(r.time)}</small><p>原因：${h(r.reason)}</p><details><summary>修改前后值与版本</summary><ul>${r.changes.map(x=>`<li>${h(x.label||'单据')} · ${h(labels[x.field]||x.field)}：${h(valueLabel(x.field,x.before))} → ${h(valueLabel(x.field,x.after))}</li>`).join('')}</ul>${b('打印此版本','print-history',`data-version="${r.revisionAfter}"`)}</details></article>`).join('')||'<p>暂无成功业务历史</p>')}

function exportDoc(d){
 if(!d)return toast('当前没有可导出的销货单');
 if(window.MASTER_DATA?.active&&(!MASTER_DATA.context()?.storeIds.includes(d.storeId)||!MASTER_DATA.context()?.warehouses.includes(d.warehouseId)))return toast('当前账号不能导出该单据');
 if(!d.lines?.length&&!d.returnLines?.length)return toast('没有可导出的销货明细');
 return MATRIX_REPORT.download(SALES_EXPORT.report(d,{useSnapshotAmounts:!dirty()}),'销货单').catch(()=>toast('销货单导出失败，请重试'));
}
function printUnified(d){
 const a=A.amounts(d),f=A.payment(d),payments=Array.isArray(d.fundsRecords)?d.fundsRecords:[f];
 const paymentTable=payments.length?`<h2>收退款明细</h2><table><thead><tr><th>方向</th><th>收款方式</th><th>资金账户</th><th>金额</th></tr></thead><tbody>${payments.map(record=>{const method=record.methodName||A.methods().find(x=>x.id===record.methodId)?.name||'未选择',account=record.accountName||A.accounts().find(x=>x.id===record.accountId)?.name||'未选择',direction=({receipt:'收款',refund:'退款',zero:'零差额'})[record.direction]||record.direction||(record.amountCents<0?'退款':'收款');return `<tr><td>${h(direction)}</td><td>${h(method)}</td><td>${h(account)}</td><td>${Number.isSafeInteger(record.amountCents)?K.money(Math.abs(record.amountCents)):'—'}</td></tr>`}).join('')}</tbody></table><p>收退款合计 ¥${payments.every(record=>Number.isSafeInteger(record.amountCents))?K.money(payments.reduce((sum,record)=>sum+record.amountCents,0)):'—'}</p>`:'<p>无收退款记录</p>';
 const table=(label,lines)=>`<h2>${label}</h2><table><thead><tr><th>款号／商品</th><th>颜色／版型／尺码</th><th>数量</th><th>单价</th><th>金额</th></tr></thead><tbody>${lines.map(l=>`<tr><td>${h(p(l.productId)?.displayId||l.productId)} ${h(l.name)}${l.gift?'（赠品）':''}</td><td>${[l.color,l.fit||C.fit?.(l.fitId)?.name,l.sourceSize||l.size].filter(Boolean).map(h).join('／')}</td><td>${l.quantity}${h(l.unit)}</td><td>${K.money(l.priceCents)}</td><td>${K.money(l.priceCents*l.quantity)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`;
 const html=`<h1>奈爵服饰 · 销货单（${h(A.type(d)==='销售'?'销售':'退货/换货')}）</h1><p>${h(d.id)} · ${h(statusLabel(d))} · v${d.revision} · ${h(d.date)}</p><p>${h(d.storeName)} · ${h(d.customerName)} · 营业员 ${h(d.salespersonName)}</p><p>${A.type(d)==='退货'?'退入仓':'出库仓'}：${h(d.warehouseName)}${A.type(d)==='换货'?'；退入仓：'+h(d.returnWarehouseName):''}</p>${A.type(d)!=='销售'?table('退回商品',A.incoming(d)):''}${A.type(d)!=='退货'?table(A.type(d)!=='销售'?'换出商品':'销售商品',A.outgoing(d)):''}<p>${A.type(d)!=='销售'?'退回金额 ¥'+K.money(a.returned)+'；':''}${A.type(d)!=='退货'?(A.type(d)==='换货'?'换出金额 ¥':'销售金额 ¥')+K.money(a.sale)+'；':''}${A.type(d)!=='销售'?(a.direction==='无'?'无需补差':(a.direction==='收款'?'还需收款':'还需退款')+' ¥'+K.money(a.amountCents)):''}</p>${paymentTable}<p>${h(d.note)}</p>`;
 U.printVersion=copy(d);modal('已保存单据打印预览',`<div id="sale-print-content">${html}</div>`,b('浏览器打印','do-print'),'','sale-print-dialog');
}
function printDoc(d){if(window.MASTER_DATA?.active&&(!MASTER_DATA.context()?.storeIds.includes(d?.storeId)||!MASTER_DATA.context()?.warehouses.includes(d?.warehouseId)))return toast('当前账号不能打印该单据');if(!d?.revision)return toast('请先保存单据');if(d.auditWorkflow)return printUnified(d);d={...d,returnSummary:null,salesFacts:salesFacts(d)};const text=`<h1>${h('奈爵服饰')} 销货单 ${h(d.id)}</h1><p>版本 ${d.revision} · ${h(statusLabel(d))} · ${h(d.date)} · ${h(d.customerName||customer(d.customerId))} · ${h((d.warehouseName||wh(d.warehouseId)))}</p><p>营业员：${h(d.salespersonName||staff(d.salespersonId))} · 制单人：${h(d.creator?.name)} · 更新：${stamp(d.updated)}</p><table><thead><tr>${['款号','商品','颜色','尺码','数量','成交单价','金额','赠品'].map(x=>'<th>'+x+'</th>').join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${d.lines.map(l=>`<tr><td>${h(p(l.productId)?.displayId||l.productId)}</td><td>${h(l.name)}</td><td>${h(l.color)}</td><td>${h(l.size)}</td><td>${l.quantity}</td><td>${K.money(l.priceCents)}</td><td>${K.money(l.quantity*l.priceCents)}</td><td>${l.gift?'是':''}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><p>${h(K.unitText(K.totals(d).units))} · 整单优惠 ${K.money(d.adjustmentCents)} · ${voided(d)?'原单金额':d.returnSummary?'原销售金额':'成交金额'} ${K.money(K.totals(d).total)} 元${voided(d)?' · 已作废，不计入有效销售':''}</p>${d.returnSummary?`<p>原销售金额 ${K.money(d.returnSummary.originalCents)} · 历次退回商品金额 ${K.money(d.returnSummary.returnedCents)} · 历次换出商品金额 ${K.money(d.returnSummary.outCents)} · 销售金额 ${K.money(d.returnSummary.netCents)}</p>`:''}<p>营业厅：${h(d.storeName||'待确认')} · 收款方式：${h(d.paymentMethodName||'未选择')} · ${h(d.note)} · 销售金额不代表收款</p>`;
 U.printVersion=copy(d);modal('已保存单据打印预览',`<div id="sale-print-content">${text}</div>`,b('浏览器打印','do-print'),'','sale-print-dialog')}
async function awaitOpenEdit(id){await S.sync();const d=window.REAL_DATA_MODE?await S.getDoc(id):S.docs.find(x=>x.id===id);if(d&&d.status==='未审核'){setDoc(d,true);navigate('sales/doc/'+encodeURIComponent(id))}}
function toast(t){window.toast(t)}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-sale]');if(!el)return;const a=el.dataset.sale,id=el.dataset.id,l=[...(U.doc?.lines||[]),...(U.doc?.returnLines||[])].find(x=>x.id===id);if(el.disabled)return;
 if(a==='close')return close();if(a==='confirm'){const fn=modalAction;close();return fn?.()}
 if(a==='new')return newDoc();if(a==='list')return leave(()=>navigate('sales',true));if(a==='open')return openDoc(id);if(a==='query')return query();if(a==='page'){U.page=Number(el.dataset.page);U.listScroll=0;return window.REAL_DATA_MODE?query():refresh()}if(a==='more-filter'){U.moreFilters=!U.moreFilters;return refresh()}if(a==='reset'){U.filter=emptyFilters();U.applied={};U.page=1;U.listScroll=0;return query()}
 if(a==='recommended-customer'){BUSINESS_CONFIG.assign(U.doc,'customerId',S.catalog.stores.find(x=>x.id===U.doc.storeId)?.defaultCustomerId||'',S.catalog);update();return refresh()}if(a==='list-edit'){awaitOpenEdit(id);return}if(a==='audit')return commit('audit');if(a==='unaudit')return modal('确认弃审','<p>撤销本单已生效的库存影响，结算明细保留，保留操作历史。弃审后可修改并重新审核。</p>',b('取消','close')+b('确认弃审','confirm','','primary'),()=>commit('unaudit'));if(a==='entry-section')return switchSection(el.dataset.section);if(a==='edit'){if(voided(U.doc))return toast('已作废单据不能修改');if(A.audited(U.doc))return toast('请由仓库人员弃审后再修改');setDoc(U.doc,true);return refresh()}if(a==='cancel-edit')return leave(async()=>{const result=await S.sync();if(!result.ok){U.error=result.error;refresh();return}const d=window.REAL_DATA_MODE?await S.getDoc(U.doc.id):S.docs.find(x=>x.id===U.doc.id);if(!d){U.error='无法读取最新单据，输入已保留';refresh();return}setDoc(d);refresh()});
 if(a==='delete-doc'){if(!U.doc?.revision||U.doc.status!=='未审核'||U.busy)return;return modal('确认作废销货单',`<p>确定作废销货单 ${h(U.doc.id)} 吗？作废后不能再编辑或审核，操作记录会保留。</p>${dirty()?'<p>当前未保存的修改会被放弃。</p>':''}`,b('取消','close')+b('确认作废','confirm','','primary'),()=>commit('delete'),'sale-confirm sale-danger')}
 if(a==='save'){if(!canEdit()||!flushInline())return;const error=validateAdjustment()||(Object.keys(U.priceErrors).length?'请填写有效成交单价':K.validation(U.doc,S.catalog,D.warehouses.filter(w=>w.enabled!==false).map(w=>w.id),D.warehouses)||SALES_FUNDS_UI.validate?.(U.doc,{audit:false}));if(error)return validationError(error);if(U.doc.revision&&!dirty())return toast('内容没有变化');return commit('save')}
 if(a==='void'){if(window.REAL_DATA_MODE)return toast('当前阶段作废未接通，本次操作未提交');if(U.doc.returnRecords?.length)return toast('该销货单已存在退换记录，不能作废');return reasonModal('void');}if(a==='reason-confirm'){const reason=$('#sale-reason').value,note=$('#sale-reason-note').value.trim();if(reason==='其他'&&!note){$('#sale-modal-error').textContent='选择其他时请填写简短说明';return}const result=reason+(note?'：'+note:'');close();return commit(el.dataset.kind,result)}
 if(a==='more-apply'){Object.assign(U.doc,U.moreDraft);U.moreDraft=null;close(true);update();return refresh();}if(a==='history')return showHistory();if(a==='toggle-scan')return openScan()
 if(a==='returns')return newDoc();
 if(a==='latest'){return S.sync().then(async r=>{if(!r.ok)return toast(r.error);const latest=window.REAL_DATA_MODE?await S.getDoc(U.latest?.id||U.doc.id):S.docs.find(x=>x.id===(U.latest?.id||U.doc.id));if(!latest)return toast('暂时无法读取最新单据');modal('最新已保存单据','<p>你的未提交输入仍保留在原页。以下为最新版本与本次输入差异：</p><ul>'+diffHTML(latest,U.doc)+'</ul>',b('保留本次输入','close')+b('打开已保存单据','open-committed',`data-id="${h(latest.id)}"`))})}
 if(a==='open-committed'){close();return openDoc(id)}
 if(a==='detail'){SCAN_WORKBENCH.pause();settleEditors();capture();return TRANSFER_UI.openSalesDetail(p(l.productId),p(l.productId).colorIds.indexOf(l.colorId),U.doc.warehouseId,()=>{refresh();$(`[data-sale="detail"][data-id="${CSS.escape(id)}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true})})}
 if(a==='export')return exportDoc(U.doc);if(a==='print')return printDoc(window.REAL_DATA_MODE?U.doc:S.docs.find(d=>d.id===U.doc.id));if(a==='print-history')return printDoc(U.doc.history.find(r=>r.revisionAfter===Number(el.dataset.version)).after);if(a==='do-print'){document.body.classList.add('sale-printing');window.print();document.body.classList.remove('sale-printing');return}
 if(!canEdit())return;
 if(a==='edit-identity'){if(l)beginIdentity(l,el.dataset.field||'商品');return}
 if(a==='confirm-identity')return confirmIdentity();
 if(a==='cancel-identity'){U.identityEdit=null;U.error='';return repaintLines()}
 if(a==='toggle-scan')return openScan();if(a==='pick')return pick();if(a==='matrix')return matrix(el.dataset.product);if(a==='matrix-add'){if(!U.matrix||U.matrix.submitted)return;settleEditors();dialog.querySelectorAll('[data-matrix]').forEach(el=>U.matrix.quantities[el.dataset.matrix]=el.value);const result=M.batch(entryDoc(),p(U.matrix.id),U.matrix.quantities,K.cents($('#sale-matrix-price').value));if(result.error){$('#sale-modal-error').textContent=result.error;return}if(!result.count){$('#sale-modal-error').textContent='请至少填写一个有效数量';return}U.matrix.submitted=true;close();U.query='';U.message='已加入 '+result.count+' 条有效规格明细';update();refresh();return focusScan()}
 if(a==='scan-target'){const c=U.scanChoice;close();return scan(c.value,c.eventId,id)}
 if(a==='undo')return undoScan();
 if(a==='remove'){U.entries=U.entries.filter(e=>e.lineId!==id);entryDoc().lines=entryDoc().lines.filter(x=>x.id!==id);delete U.rawPrices[id];delete U.priceErrors[id];update();return refresh()}
 if(a==='gift'){if(l.gift){l.gift=false;l.priceCents=l.previousPrice??null;l.zeroConfirmed=l.priceCents===0}else{l.previousPrice=l.priceCents;l.gift=true;l.priceCents=0;l.zeroConfirmed=false}delete U.rawPrices[id];delete U.priceErrors[id];const merged=M.collapse(entryDoc());if(merged.error)return validationError(merged.error);mapMergedRecords(merged.aliases);update();return refresh()}
 if(a==='zero'){modal('确认普通零价商品','<p>此行单价为0.00元，不标为赠品，审核时仍按业务类型处理商品数量。</p>',b('取消','close')+b('确认零价','confirm','','primary'),()=>{l.zeroConfirmed=true;update();refresh()},'sale-confirm');return}
 if(a==='discount'){modal('折扣辅助算价',`<p>参考零售价 ${K.money(l.referenceCents)} 元。确认时计算成交价，之后不会按显示折扣反算。</p><label>折扣（0–10折）<input id="sale-discount" inputmode="decimal"></label><p id="sale-modal-error" role="alert"></p>`,b('取消','close')+b('应用','discount-apply',`data-id="${id}"`));return}
 if(a==='discount-apply'){const x=K.cents($('#sale-discount').value);if(x===null||x>1000||!l.referenceCents){$('#sale-modal-error').textContent='请填写0–10折，且商品有参考售价';return}l.priceCents=Number((BigInt(l.referenceCents)*BigInt(x)+500n)/1000n);l.zeroConfirmed=l.priceCents===0;delete U.rawPrices[id];delete U.priceErrors[id];close();update();return refresh()}
 if(a==='adjust'){modal('整单优惠／抹零',`<label>优惠金额（元）<input id="sale-adjustment" inputmode="decimal" value="${U.doc.adjustmentCents?'-':''}${K.money(U.doc.adjustmentCents)}"></label><p>正负输入均按优惠处理，始终减少应收金额；确认后以负数展示。</p><p id="sale-modal-error" role="alert"></p>`,b('取消','close')+b('确认','adjust-apply','','primary'));return}
 if(a==='adjust-apply'){const v=K.cents($('#sale-adjustment').value.trim().replace(/^[-+]/,''));if(v===null||v>K.totals(U.doc).gross){$('#sale-modal-error').textContent='优惠金额不能大于商品金额';return}U.doc.adjustmentCents=v;close();update();return refresh()}
});
